QueuePass sign-in theme (keycloak/themes/queuepass)

login/resources/img/stone-lines.png is derived from Keycloak's keycloak-bg.png
(theme/keycloak/login/resources/img/keycloak-bg.png in Keycloak 26.0.8's
org.keycloak.keycloak-themes jar; SHA-256
0825175291be11f7689e8718295e422bb6fa4f8fefccc5610292b720c701ac4e).

