Change made: the image was reduced to the edges between the stones, as an alpha mask (white,
opaque on the edges, with a half-opaque rim, and clear elsewhere), by the generator in
scripts/seed/src/stone-lines/ (spec 027 research R3). Make it again, or check it, with:

  npm run stone-lines --workspace @queuepass/seed -- [--check] <keycloak-bg.png>

The sign-in pages load keycloak-bg.png itself from Keycloak's own theme; this repository holds no
copy of it.
